NOTICE:  scope "tenant_id": the direct pairs of "grants" (dim_a_id, tenant_id) are the rows of its unique btree "grants_direct" that satisfy (deleted_at IS NULL)
NOTICE:  scope "tenant_id": the joined pairs of "grants" (group_id, tenant_id) are the rows of its unique btree "grants_other" that satisfy (id > 0)
NOTICE:  scope "tenant_id": the via members of "memberships" (group_id, dim_a_id) are the rows of its unique btree "memberships_active" that satisfy (deleted_at IS NULL)
